# Earthbender Ascension's landfall: "put a quest counter on this enchantment. When you do, if it has four or more quest counters on it,
# put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. It gains trample until end of turn." Turn 1: the fetched Island is counter 1.
# Turn 3: Prismatic Vista entering is counter 2 and the basic it fetches is counter 3 - three is too few, so nothing is put on the stack
# and no creature gets a counter. Turn 5: a Forest is counter 4: Bot1 chooses the Ornithopter, which gets a +1/+1 counter and trample
# until end of turn (gone again on turn 6; the counter stays). Turn 7: a Forest is counter 5 - "four or more" - and the earthbent Forest gets
# the +1/+1 counter. (The creature choice is asked because there are two: the earthbent Forest and the Ornithopter.)

